__________________________________________________ New York Comedy Festival
 
 audiences will get an exclusive look at the new season of NBC's hit series
 
 The Fall and Rise of Reggie Dinkins. The event will feature an advanced sc
 
reening of episode 3\, followed by a conversation with the cast and creativ
 
e team about bringing the series to life. The panel will feature actors Tra
 
cy Morgan\, Daniel Radcliffe\, Erika Alexander\, Bobby Moynihan\, Precious 
 
Way\, and Jalyn Hall\, alongside series co-creators and executive producers
 
 Robert Carlock and Sam Means. Moderated by Josh Horowitz. The new season p
 
remieres November 2 on NBC and next day on Peacock. Tickets & info: https:/
 
