exploring the classical side of the musical world that shaped Bill Evans\, 
 
and music that he in turn inspired. The program brings together music by Ba
 
ch\, Ravel\, Debu Tickets & info: https://greenwichhouse.org/event/reflecti
 
ons-in-music-time-remembered/
